\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Energy vs. magnetization in DOS diagrams for sub-lattices of size 3 and 4. (a) The size of 3, (b) The size of 4. Red points stand for the magnetization for a state composed of the whole spins and blue points for the magnetization of the tau spins. The ground state (of the lowest energy) is 2-fold degenerated in the size of 3 and not degenerated in the size of 4. The natural units can be found in Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {app:natUnit}.\relax }}{7}{figure.caption.11}}
